<H1 ALIGN=CENTER>MHTML test</H1>

<P><BLOCKQUOTE>
 This is a test of multipart/related using <B>Content-Location</B> 
headers: the IMG reference is to an absolute URL, but it should come
out of the message (the frog) rather than off the net (jwz.)
</BLOCKQUOTE>

<CENTER>

<P>
<TABLE WIDTH=240 BORDER=4 CELLSPACING=10 CELLPADDING=4>
 <TR ALIGN=CENTER>
  <TH>A picture of a frog in a cage should appear below:</TH>
 </TR>
 <TR ALIGN=CENTER>
  <TD>
   <IMG SRC="http://www.netscape.com/people/jwz/jwz6.jpg">
  </TD>
 </TR>
 <TR ALIGN=CENTER>
  <TD>(Not a picture of jwz.)</TD>
 </TR>
</TABLE>

<P>Nothing should appear after this line.
</CENTER>

